<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-SWISS OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWISS OPEN QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>GSTAAD, Switzerland 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final</p>
<p>results from the Swiss Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Juan Albert Viloca (Spain) beat Nicolas Kiefer (Germany) 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>2-Alex Corretja (Spain) beat 7-Alberto Berasategui (Spain) 6-4</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>6-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Javier Sanchez (Spain) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Marc Rosset (Switzerland)</p>
<p>7-5 7-6 (12-10)</p>
</text>
